                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The project quidelines for the Centrally Sponsored Project for Computerization of Primary Agricultural Credit Societies (PACS) were issued to all the States/UTs vide this Ministry's letter dated 02.01.2023. Subsequently, during the 3rd meeting of the National Level Monitoring and Implementation Committee (NLMIC) held on 06.06.2023 under the chairmanship of Secretary (M/o Cooperation). As decided in the meeting the following revisions modification are hereby made to the project guidelines:"
